    "body": "# Lamprey v0.31.0 \u00e2\u20ac\u201d Triple Lane\n\nReleased 2026-08-23. Source wrap. Installer artifacts stay on v0.30.0\nuntil Bucket (TL-W4, coordinator).\n\n## Lane A \u00e2\u20ac\u201d Claude Code refresh\n\n- Inventory pinned to Claude Code **2.1.241** (GitHub tag 2026-08-23).\n- Pick list empty (K12). Empty Lane A is success. No product deltas.\n\n## Lane B \u00e2\u20ac\u201d OpenRouter routing depth\n\n- Opt-in OpenRouter path can send fallbacks plus provider\n  sort / order / ignore. Empty routing stays `{}` (K4).\n- `openrouter/auto` is offered when an OpenRouter key is present. It is\n  not a `MODEL_CATALOG` row.\n- Direct-provider default is unchanged. Catalog still has zero\n  OpenRouter-brokered aliases.\n\n## Lane C \u00e2\u20ac\u201d Local endpoint polish\n\n- Settings presets for Ollama, LM Studio, and Unsloth Studio API.\n- Connection-refused probes use loud copy instead of a generic fetch\n  failure.\n- Live local imports still default tools and vision off. Local tools\n  still pass approval / snip / gates (K10).\n- No Unsloth training UI in core (K6).\n\n## Non-goals held\n\n- No Unburdening rebuild.\n- No `MODEL_CATALOG` fabrication.\n- No plugin-tool runtime.\n- No Bucket on this wrap.\n\nAuthored and reviewed by Basho Parks, copyright 2026\n",
